The profiler counts the lock and wait syscalls (svcArbitrateLock/Unlock, svcWaitForAddress, svcSignalToAddress, svcWaitProcessWideKeyAtomic, svcSignalProcessWideKey: calls per second and the time inside) by wrapping them like svcSleepThread; one more line in each 10 s report.

